Package: stateELP
Title: Evaluate and Set English Learner Exit Thresholds
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Nathan", "Dadey", email = "ndadey@nciea.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Analytic engine for the process "Evaluating and Setting English
    Learner Exit Thresholds": three preparation stages that document policy,
    population and program context, four data checks that describe exit timing,
    who gets stuck, academic patterns by English language proficiency, and
    decision consistency, and a closing synthesis stage. The deliverable is a
    set of Quarto documents, one per stage; the functions here exist to make
    those render.
